{"seq":1,"slug":"medusa-heads","title":"Medusa 多头","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/advanced/medusa-heads","wordCount":1129,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"medusa-多头\">Medusa 多头</h1><p>要给一个已经训练完成、不想重训的大模型加上推测能力，最轻的改造是什么？Medusa（2024）给出的答案是：别动主干，在最后一层隐藏状态上并排焊几个小小的「预测头」，让它们各自负责预测「往后第 2、3、4 个位置」的 token。主模型一次前向，这几个头就同时吐出一束候选，连第二个模型都省了。它的训练成本低到可以在消费级 GPU 上几小时搞定，这是它一度风靡的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-在末层并排挂多个预测头\">核心概念：在末层并排挂多个预测头</h2><p>标准 LM 只有一个输出头，把末层隐藏状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 映射到「下一个 token」的分布。Medusa 在同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上再并排加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 个独立的头，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个头专门预测「往后第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个位置」的 token：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mtext>softmax</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}_t^{(k)} = \\text{softmax}\\big(W^{(k)} \\cdot h_t\\big),\\quad k = 1, 2, \\dots, K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2906em;vertical-align:-0.2458em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.288em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">softmax</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;主模型前向&lt;br/&gt;得到末层隐藏状态 h_t&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;原 LM 头: 预测 t+1&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;Medusa 头 1: 预测 t+2&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; D[&quot;Medusa 头 2: 预测 t+3&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; E[&quot;Medusa 头 3: 预测 t+4&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; F[&quot;一束候选 token&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; F&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;组合成候选 -&gt; 树注意力并行验证&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"主模型前向&lt;br/&gt;得到末层隐藏状态 h_t\"] --&gt; B[\"原 LM 头: 预测 t+1\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"Medusa 头 1: 预测 t+2\"]\n  A --&gt; D[\"Medusa 头 2: 预测 t+3\"]\n  A --&gt; E[\"Medusa 头 3: 预测 t+4\"]\n  B --&gt; F[\"一束候选 token\"]\n  C --&gt; F\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[\"组合成候选 -&gt; 树注意力并行验证\"]</pre><p>注意所有头都只看同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：它们<strong>彼此之间不传递信息</strong>，也不看主模型的中间层。第 2 个头预测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t+3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 时，并不知道第 1 个头给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t+2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 猜了什么。这种「各猜各的、互不依赖」正是 Medusa 的简单之处，也是它的精度短板所在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"训练-冻结主干-只训头\">训练：冻结主干，只训头</h2><p>Medusa 的轻量来自训练方式。两种模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>主模型</th>\n<th>训练对象</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n<th>质量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Medusa-1</td>\n<td>完全冻结</td>\n<td>仅 Medusa 头</td>\n<td>极低，几小时</td>\n<td>主模型零退化，接受率中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Medusa-2</td>\n<td>联合微调</td>\n<td>头 + 主干（小学习率）</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>接受率更好，需防主模型退化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Medusa-1 因为冻结主干，绝不会损害主模型本身的质量——而且别忘了，推测解码本身是 <a href=\"../foundations/lossless-guarantee\">无损</a> 的，头猜得再差也只降速不降质。这让「先上 Medusa-1 试水」成为一个零风险的选择：不行就关掉，主模型分毫无损。</p>\n<p>训练目标是让每个头去拟合「真实的未来第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token」，本质是个多位置的交叉熵：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>Medusa</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>CrossEntropy</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{Medusa}} = \\sum_{k=1}^{K} \\lambda_k \\cdot \\text{CrossEntropy}\\big(\\hat{p}_t^{(k)},\\, x_{t+k+1}\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Medusa</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3948em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CrossEntropy</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"候选组合与树验证\">候选组合与树验证</h2><p>每个头各给出 top-若干个候选，把不同头的候选做笛卡尔组合，就得到许多条「未来 token 路径」。Medusa 不是逐条串行验证，而是把这些路径组织成一棵树，用<strong>树注意力</strong>在目标模型的一次前向里并行验证全部——这套机制是它和 EAGLE 共享的，详见 <a href=\"tree-attention-verify\">树注意力与多候选验证</a>。本篇只需记住：多个头 + 树验证，让 Medusa 一轮能接受不止一个 token。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么被-eagle-超越-信息瓶颈\">为什么被 EAGLE 超越：信息瓶颈</h2><p>Medusa 简单，但精度上有个结构性短板，2025–2026 年的生产部署已基本用 EAGLE 取代它。根因是两点：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[Medusa 的精度短板] --&gt; B[&quot;头之间不共享上下文&lt;br/&gt;第 k 个头不知道前一个头猜了什么&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;只用末层 h_t&lt;br/&gt;丢弃了中间层的丰富特征&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; D[&quot;靠后位置接受率掉得快&lt;br/&gt;长文本生成尤其明显&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;草稿表征能力受限&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;EAGLE: 特征级自回归&lt;br/&gt;头之间传递特征&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F\">graph TD\n  A[Medusa 的精度短板] --&gt; B[\"头之间不共享上下文&lt;br/&gt;第 k 个头不知道前一个头猜了什么\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"只用末层 h_t&lt;br/&gt;丢弃了中间层的丰富特征\"]\n  B --&gt; D[\"靠后位置接受率掉得快&lt;br/&gt;长文本生成尤其明显\"]\n  C --&gt; E[\"草稿表征能力受限\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"EAGLE: 特征级自回归&lt;br/&gt;头之间传递特征\"]\n  E --&gt; F</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>头之间不通信</strong>：每个头独立预测，无法利用「前一个头已经决定了什么」，等于强行让模型在不知道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t+2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 的情况下猜 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t+3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>，靠后位置自然越来越不准。</li>\n<li><strong>只用末层特征</strong>：末层主要编码「下一个 token 的输出分布」，丢掉了浅层的句法、中层的语义。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>EAGLE 正是针对这两点改进——它在<strong>特征层</strong>做自回归（头之间传特征而非各猜各的），并融合多层特征。结果是在 H100 上 EAGLE-3 比 Medusa-2 在每秒 token 数上高出 15% 到 25%（公开基准）。所以 2026 年的现实是：Medusa 适合作为「最简单的入门款」或训练管线极受限时的选择，新部署普遍直接上 <a href=\"eagle-feature\">EAGLE 特征级推测</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Medusa 在主模型末层隐藏状态上并排挂 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 个轻量预测头，分别预测未来第 2、3、4 个位置的 token，无需第二个模型。</li>\n<li>训练轻：Medusa-1 冻结主干只训头（零主模型退化、几小时可成），Medusa-2 联合微调换更高接受率；叠加推测本身的无损性，上手零质量风险。</li>\n<li>多头候选组合成树，用树注意力在目标模型一次前向里并行验证。</li>\n<li>结构短板是「头间不通信 + 只用末层特征」，靠后位置接受率衰减快；2025–2026 已被在特征层自回归、融合多层的 EAGLE 全面超越（H100 上 EAGLE-3 比 Medusa-2 快 15–25%）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：取代 Medusa 的标杆方案见 <a href=\"eagle-feature\">EAGLE 特征级推测</a>，候选树的验证机制见 <a href=\"tree-attention-verify\">树注意力与多候选验证</a>；与 Medusa 形态相似但属预训练的 MTP 见 <a href=\"../draft-models/self-speculative\">自推测与早退</a>。跨库可参考 <a href=\"../../llm-reasoning-test-time-compute/test-time-compute/verification-self-correction\">LLM 推理与测试时计算 · 验证与自我纠正</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Medusa 多头","id":"medusa-多头"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：在末层并排挂多个预测头","id":"核心概念-在末层并排挂多个预测头"},{"level":2,"text":"训练：冻结主干，只训头","id":"训练-冻结主干-只训头"},{"level":2,"text":"候选组合与树验证","id":"候选组合与树验证"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么被 EAGLE 超越：信息瓶颈","id":"为什么被-eagle-超越-信息瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"n-gram 与检索草稿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/draft-models/ngram-retrieval-draft"},"next":{"title":"EAGLE 特征级推测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/advanced/eagle-feature"}}